:0.37048665618057641,"x":0.24279835749878431,"h":0.011780785616001932},{"h":0.013081394896215182,"y":0.3924418606732587,"text":"My group started at 9.45.","x":0.24279835455156482,"w":0.17695473564995659},{"w":0.19958847045898437,"text":"At first, it was impossible to","x":0.24279835985795634,"h":0.011627906907110019,"y":0.40843023252028221},{"h":0.011627906907110019,"text":"run fast because there were so many runners. All the runners","x":0.039094659850554887,"y":0.4229651162654372,"w":0.42798353407118056},{"text":"were in weird costumes - one runner wore a Dracula outfit,","x":0.039094660373263757,"y":0.43877551003794046,"w":0.41152262369791665,"h":0.010352396703028566},{"text":"there was a woman in a wedding dress, and lots of runners","y":0.45329670302645442,"w":0.40946499294704863,"h":0.013343799058084804,"x":0.039094668718519437},{"x":0.039094658750817045,"text":"came in different animal costumes.","h":0.010263407436233107,"w":0.24897118462456594,"y":0.46938775516108266},{"x":0.039094662561286228,"w":0.33539093017578125,"h":0.01162790690711013,"y":0.49127906980225888,"text":"After half an hour, I had more space around me."},{"w":0.41152262369791665,"text":"I remembered to run at the same speed and to take a drink","y":0.50581395332939083,"h":0.011627906907110019,"x":0.037037035270383475},{"text":"of water every fifteen minutes. After twelve miles I was really","x":0.039094649775832754,"w":0.41975307888454855,"y":0.52180232570342178,"h":0.011627906907110019},{"w":0.40329216851128469,"x":0.039094652452176665,"y":0.53767660905016457,"text":"tired. Suddenly, I saw my mum and my sister in the crowd","h":0.011773940345368938},{"text":"near Tower Bridge. And after that, I felt a lot better!","w":0.36456498887803823,"y":0.5499045784477582,"x":0.038898619927217624,"h":0.01688202284568896},{"h":0.013081394896215293,"w":0.41563785129123265,"x":0.039094659539568678,"text":"Then I just concentrated on running. I reached the finishing","y":0.57412790698503191},{"h":0.0116279